  "notes": [
    "-ER verb with spelling change: g→j before a/o (to preserve the soft /x/ sound)",
    "Only the **yo Presente** is affected in indicative: **recojo**",
    "All other indicative forms keep the g (recoges, recoge, recogemos, etc.)",
    "The g→j change also applies throughout the present subjunctive (recoja, recojas, etc.)",
    "Past participle: recogido",
    "Common meanings: to pick up (recoger a alguien = to pick someone up), to collect (recoger datos = to gather data), to tidy up (recoger la mesa = to clear the table)"
  ],
